Add cloth texture near banner. It should tile. Use 256, base mid-gray 200, vertical fold shading, horizontal weave, stains. Import in character.js and use as map.

Because cloth material color multiplies texture; if texture base gray ~200, final color darker by 0.78. Set color a bit brighter to compensate (e.g., 0x6e1710 for cape). Or make texture near-white with subtle variation. Let's do base 220 and shading .82-1.0. Then color 0x5e120b will render dark red. Fine.

