But texture repeat default 1; cape planes each get map stretched. With vertex UVs 0..1 per segment, the texture repeats per segment (good, weave scale). Since we have vertical folds baked, plus geometry folds, could be nice.

Also darker cape width: .46 top, .052 decrease (bottom .25)? At bottom too narrow maybe .30. Use width .48 - i*.045 => .30. Top .48 vs torso .44; okay. Change cloth color to 0x4f110b.

Also fix cape top shape: the V notch at top comes from torso covering center. Fine.

